            <ArticleTitle>[The dynamics of the clinico-functional indices in patients with ischemic heart disease under the influence of repeated courses of laser therapy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>9-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Repeated courses of laser therapy given to patients with ischemic heart disease, angina of effort class I-IV for 2 years brought about stabilization of coronary insufficiency and improvement of clinical and functional conditions. Microcirculatory picture of the bulbar conjunctiva, coronary reserve improved. The treatment had also a hypotensive effect.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
